	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `av` to search the whole aardvark index — Johnny Decimal ref, title, folder or description.

↩ opens every mirror the entity is synced to
⌘ reveals the folder in Finder
⌥ opens a terminal tab at the folder
⌃ shows Craft, Todoist, Google Drive and Dropbox as four rows

Install and update this workflow with `aardvark install_alfred`, which also records where the `aardvark` command lives on this Mac. Remove it with `aardvark install_alfred --uninstall`.

Two settings are configurable: the terminal app the ⌥ handoff opens, and an explicit path to the `aardvark` command if the recorded one is ever wrong.</string>
